{"4728660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Midnight Nasi Goreng", "steam_appid": 4728660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a late-night street food vendor in <strong>Midnight Nasi Goreng</strong>. Set in the quiet corners of <strong>Indonesia</strong>, this psychological horror experience focuses on atmospheric tension and the unsettling feeling of being watched while performing routine tasks under the dim city lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Atmosphere:</strong> Experience high-contrast lighting and a chilling environment built in Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Manage your food stall while staying alert to strange occurrences during your shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Environments:</strong> Explore a highly detailed setting using realistic assets to ground the horror in a familiar world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused Horror Experience:</strong> A streamlined and chilling session designed for players who want a direct and atmospheric horror encounter.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a late-night street food vendor in <strong>Midnight Nasi Goreng</strong>. Set in the quiet corners of <strong>Indonesia</strong>, this psychological horror experience focuses on atmospheric tension and the unsettling feeling of being watched while performing routine tasks under the dim city lights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Atmosphere:</strong> Experience high-contrast lighting and a chilling environment built in Unreal Engine 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Gameplay:</strong> Manage your food stall while staying alert to strange occurrences during your shift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detailed Environments:</strong> Explore a highly detailed setting using realistic assets to ground the horror in a familiar world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused Horror Experience:</strong> A streamlined and chilling session designed for players who want a direct and atmospheric horror encounter.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Experience the grit of the Indonesian night shift. Manage a street food stall through accurate architectural spaces and eerie corridors. In this world of meticulous dread, the grind never ends—and something in the shadows is watching.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728660/08ae16407cbff079967f0f0ed82ff076a674ca69/header.jpg?t=1780397333", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728660/7ad7cf26bb0957e228c9a5c93816ef89ea7d202d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780397333", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4728660/7ad7cf26bb0957e228c9a5c93816ef89ea7d202d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780397333", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580 (6 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 1